OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Faway from the coast, with clear skies
OL,7,Fdeveloping widely inland. Cloudier
OL,8,Fconditions are expected near the
OL,9,Fcoast, where a few showers remain
OL,10,Fpossible. Turning chilly overnight,
OL,11,Fespecially inland, with a risk of an
OL,12,Fisolated rural frost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FA few isolated coastal
OL,15,Fshowers are likely to continue, but
OL,16,Felsewhere it will be mainly dry with
OL,17,Fplenty of sunny spells. Breezy at
OL,18,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
